  "title": "Week of November 21 Observation — The Sun's Position Remains Firm, Yet the Universe's Core Trembles",
  "summary": "As Apple holds the Sun's position, a broad decline among semiconductor planets and the entry of new forces have shaken the order of the universe.",
  "body": "<h3>Stability and Instability in the Solar System</h3><p>Apple maintained the Sun's position with a market cap of $4.98T. There has been no change in ranking compared to last week, and the master of the Throne remains firmly established. However, in absolute terms, Apple itself recorded a weekly decline of $3.8T, demonstrating that even the Sun has moments when it loses its light. Microsoft ($3.6T) and Alphabet ($3.25T) each maintained their 2nd and 3rd positions, preserving the orbital trajectory of the major planets revolving around the Sun.</p><p>Within the top 5, Nvidia ($3.03T) and Amazon ($2.67T) preserved their rankings, but Nvidia's weekly decline of $22.9T revealed the instability of the solar system's core. Amazon also retains room for further advancement.</p><h3>Crisis Among Semiconductor Planets</h3><p>The most notable phenomenon this week is the widespread decline among semiconductor industry planets. Micron Technology recorded a decline of $23.6T, and TSMC recorded a decline of $20.1T, which signals a shift in the status of an entire industry sector beyond mere volatility. The region of the cosmic order that these planets have managed is being reorganized.</p><h3>Transition Between Old and New Forces</h3><p>The flow of the universe continues. Anthropic, a developer of human-level AI, newly entered the observation scope, while ExxonMobil, a giant in the energy industry, was removed from tracking. This signifies that the center of gravity for capital concentration in industries has shifted with greater clarity.</p><p>Meanwhile, there are planets drawing attention as future star candidates. MediaTek recorded a momentum of 173, Dell recorded 133, and SK Hynix recorded 115, suggesting these may have reached a critical threshold for a rise in status. The universe's record calmly documents this process of change.</p><div class=\"col-chart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 700 310\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"wg2\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#9c7a3a\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#f2ba3c\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"700\" height=\"310\" fill=\"#10141f\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#f2ba3c\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\">This Week's Stars — Blazing Stars and Fading Stars</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#8a94b8\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"600\">Earth TOP 20 Weekly Market Cap Increase/Decrease Rates, Top and Bottom</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#e6ebfa\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">Saudi Aramco</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"80\" width=\"5\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#wg2)\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"800\">+0.3%</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"128\" fill=\"#e6ebfa\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">Walmart</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"113\" width=\"4\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#wg2)\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"128\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"800\">-0.1%</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"161\" fill=\"#e6ebfa\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">Apple</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"146\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#wg2)\"/><text x=\"271\" y=\"161\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"800\">-3.8%</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"193\" fill=\"#e6ebfa\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">Micron Technolog</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"178\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#386ee1\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"193\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"800\">-23.6%</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"226\" fill=\"#e6ebfa\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">NVIDIA</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"211\" width=\"369\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#386ee1\"/><text x=\"579\" y=\"226\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"800\">-22.9%</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"259\" fill=\"#e6ebfa\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">TSMC</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"244\" width=\"324\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#386ee1\"/><text x=\"534\" y=\"259\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"800\">-20.1%</text><text x=\"674\" y=\"296\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#9c7a3a\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"800\">UNIVERTRIX · univertrix.com</text></svg></div><div class=\"col-chart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 700 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"wg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f2ba3c\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#9c7a3a\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"700\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#10141f\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#f2ba3c\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\">This Week's Solar System — TOP 5 Market Capitalization</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#8a94b8\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"600\">In Trillions of Dollars ($T) · 2026-11-21</text><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"244\" x2=\"674\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#3a4568\"/><rect x=\"67\" y=\"78\" width=\"69\" height=\"166\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"url(#wg)\"/><text x=\"102\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\">4.98</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8d0ea\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">Apple</text><rect x=\"191\" y=\"124\" width=\"69\" height=\"120\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"url(#wg)\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\">3.6</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8d0ea\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">Microsoft</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"136\" width=\"69\" height=\"108\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"url(#wg)\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\">3.25</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8d0ea\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">Alphabet</text><rect x=\"439\" y=\"143\" width=\"69\" height=\"101\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"url(#wg)\"/><text x=\"474\" y=\"133\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800